  "description": "GENUINE DERIVATION (not empirical fit) of sibling PR #1125's binomial pattern c_{2j}(T(2,2m)) = C(m+j, 2j)/2. Derives from Chebyshev polynomial structure of cosh-quotients via Hecke trace = T_{2m+1}(x)/x with x = cosh(φ), q = e^φ. Verifies the load-bearing Chebyshev identity symbolically for m = 0..6.",
